      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 18, height: 18, borderRadius: 9, background: '#C0392B' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D2939', marginTop: 10 }}>2021-09-13</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B7686' }}>组合峰值</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1.6, height: 3, background: '#C0392B', opacity: 0.35 }} />
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 18, height: 18, borderRadius: 9, background: '#1D2939' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D2939', marginTop: 10 }}>2021-11-10</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B7686' }}>谷底 · 浮亏最大</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1.6, height: 3, background: '#1D2939', opacity: 0.35 }} />
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 18, height: 18, borderRadius: 9, background: '#27AE60' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D2939', marginTop: 10 }}>2022-02-08</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B7686' }}>收复峰值</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#6B7686', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 30 }}>
        期间每月继续定投 ¥10,000 —— 正是这些"下跌时的买入"，让组合更快收复失地。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#EEF2F7', borderRadius: 14, padding: 22 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#6B7686' }}>红利低波</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0392B' }}>-¥129,309</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B7686' }}>-14.79% · 2022-02-08 收复</Text>
