      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF5F3', borderRadius: 14, padding: 22, border: '1px solid #F2D0CB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8C2F28', lineHeight: 1.7, fontWeight: 600 }}>
          💡 此刻的选择决定收益：停止定投 = 把浮亏变实亏；继续定投 = 把坑填浅一半
